Date: Mon, 19 Oct 2026 09:55:48 +0000
Subject: [M150-LTS][modules] Do not cache star exports after linking
MIME-Version: 1.0
Content-Type: text/plain; charset=UTF-8
Content-Transfer-Encoding: 8bit

Only cache star-exported bindings into Module::exports() while the
module is still linking (status <= kLinking). Once a module is linked,
mutating its export table can invalidate LoadIC handler indices on an
already-finalized JSModuleNamespace or JSDeferredModuleNamespace, and
can pollute exports when a later cyclic dynamic import fails to link.

Also check both normal and deferred namespaces in ExportsFinalized()
and assert !ExportsFinalized() in Module::set_exports().

TAG=agy
CONV=67e5398e-04e3-4d05-9f15-4cb1a89b653b
